id: settings-persist
section: Keyboard and text
item: A setting changed by finger sticks across the daemon's stop and start (as upstart stops it): a checkbox on about:settings read back after the restart
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: about:settings
kit: cavekit-preferences-ui.md R2
wait rect page-title 20
calibrate page-title
tap 'sel:button.pane-tab[data-pane="general"]'
wait rect 'sel:button.pane-tab.on[data-pane="general"]' 5
tap 'sel:.row[data-pref="general.smoothScroll"] input'
wait pref b general.smoothScroll true 5
daemon-restart about:settings
wait rect page-title 30
calibrate page-title
wait pref b general.smoothScroll true 5
